# The pages that list things, with nothing to list, in a short window,
# whose pages down the side scroll to the one shown; and the Agents
# page's end, with what's native to each agent.
size 1280x520
keys <C-;>:Settings<CR>
wait-for Appearance
shot short-appearance
keys }}}}}}
wait-for New specialist
shot short-specialists
keys }
wait-for No skills yet
shot short-skills
keys }
wait-for Add a server
shot short-mcp
keys }
wait-for Who answers agents
shot short-permissions
size 1280x900
keys {{{{G
shot agents-end
